Billing system with different abilities:
   Prepaid & Postpaid Services
   Prepaid Cards 
   PPPoE, PPTP, L2TP, IPSec 
   Hotspot
   NetFlow 
   PON Managment (ZTE,BDCOM,Elxte,Huawai,V-Solution,C-DATA,STELS)
   CRM
   ERP
   NMS
   IVR
   VoIP (GNU gatekeeper, Asterisk) 
   CMTS (BSR1000 monitoring) 
   Mail management (Postfix, Spamassassin, Courier IMAP/POP) 
   SNMP Monitoring (D-Link, Cisco, Zyxel, Patton, Mikrotik) 
   IPTV (VoD,nVoD,OTT)
   Antivirus 
   Marketing Reports
   Support over 250 Payments Systems
   Powerful Restful API

Technology: 
   FreeBSD, Linux, MySQL, Radius, DHCP, Netflow, SNMP, SMTP

NAS Servers:
  Cisco/Cisco ISG/BNG
  Ericson RedBack
  Huawei ISG/BNG/FWA
  ZTE
  Juniper
  Mikrotik
  Linux Accel-ppp
  Freebsd MPD


